From 3b171464161e27db5b999c43e0954248ff11b10b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lakr233 <git@qaq.wiki>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:44:22 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 68/68] vgpu: map XR10 IOSurface FourCCs and render per-plane
 type-11 views

Map the b3a8, w30r, w40a/w40m, l10r and single-channel IOSurface FourCCs to their Metal formats and keep the two-plane XR10 format latched on the mapping. A type-11 texture created on one plane of a multi-plane surface now renders, stores, seeds and samples through that plane: its declared format and geometry pick the plane window, its resident is keyed on that format, and the Store is copied through the native rail so the other plane is left alone. Whole-surface b3a8 binds read plane 0 colour with plane 1 alpha from guest pages. BGR10_XR residents sample opaque alpha, and XR10 or per-plane attachments never alias guest pages directly.
---
